WEBVTT

00:22:28.792 --> 00:22:30.833
h-e-a-r-t work to do,

00:22:32.250 --> 00:22:36.976
in the midst of all the h-a-r-d,
hard work to do.

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:39.833
Because heart work is hard work.

00:22:41.167 --> 00:22:42.684
One of the things we have to do

00:22:42.708 --> 00:22:47.143
is we have to ensure that everyone,

00:22:47.167 --> 00:22:50.768
especially my white brothers and sisters,

00:22:50.792 --> 00:22:56.018
have to engage in the heart work,
the antiracism work,

00:22:56.042 --> 00:22:57.458
in our hearts.

00:22:58.417 --> 00:23:01.559
No one is exempt from this,